<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n234920> a ns2:UFCurrentEntity,
        ns2:UFEntity,
        ns1:GraduateStudent ;
    ns5:modTime "2014-05-07T13:28:07"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ns1:overview """<!--[if gte mso 9]><xml> <o:OfficeDocumentSettings> <o:AllowPNG /> </o:OfficeDocumentSettings> </xml><![endif]-->\r
<p>I earned my B.Sci. in Earth Science from the University of California, Santa Cruz. I am particularly interested in further developing technologies for containment, remediation, and monitoring of pollutants in the environment. My previous research involved atmospheric mercury (Hg) and its uptake in terrestrial arthropods. Currently I am exploring air pollution control with my advisers Dr. Chang-Yu Wu and Dr. Tara Sabo-Attwood.</p>\r
