    ns1:overview "As Professor and Dean of the College of Health and Human Performance at the University of Florida. Directed the administrative and academic affairs of a college consisting of three departments: Applied Physiology &amp; Kinesiology; Health Education and Behavior; Tourism, Recreation &amp; Sport Management. Direct the administrative and academic affairs of a college consisting of over 55 faculty members,approximately 80 paid graduate assistants and over 35 support staff. The annual budget for the college included over $9 million annually in state funds, $5 million annually in research expenditures and over $3 million in endowments." .

