    ns1:researchOverview "* Strong expertise in structure-based lead designing and structure activity relationship studies.<br />* Developed different computing protocols for virtual screening of molecular designs &amp; libraries<br />* Multidisciplinary work involving application of statistics and computational methods to biology and medicine.<br />* Key contribution in developing couple of research proposals that was partnered with top US Industries<br />* Collaborated with College of Medicine for validating the QSAR models and predictions.<br />* Research collaboration with IIT Bombay, J&amp;J, NCI, Cancer Research Institute, Egypt and Henkel.<br />* Evaluated new modeling softwares<br />* Co-inventor in published patents" .

