    ns1:overview "I am a quantitative ecologist that employs observational, experimental, and mathematical tools to address questions in conservation, population, and community ecology." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Broadly, my research aims to understand how individual level processes (e.g. phenotypic plasticity) influence species interactions and the ecological linkages that form when interactions in one habitat spillover into other, sometimes distinct, habitats." .

