    ns1:overview "Founded in 1929, The Bureau of Economic and Business Research (BEBR) is an applied research center in the University of Florida's, College of Liberal Arts and Sciences. BEBR&rsquo;s mission is to collect, analyze and generate economic and demographic data on Florida and its local areas; conduct economic and demographic research that will inform public policy and business decision making; and to distribute data and research findings throughout the state and the nation." ;
