    ns1:researchOverview "My Research Interests include:<br />&bull; The impact of structured youth programs and youth sport on communities, families, and students&bull;&nbsp;Culturally-sensitive organizational management in youth-focused settings&bull;&nbsp;Program evaluation and development of youth programs&bull;&nbsp;Psychological predictors of adherence to medical regimen" .

