    ns1:researchOverview "Identifying genetic and non-genetic factors that contribute to interindividual variability of the expression and activity of drug transporters and drug metabolism enzymes. Through a combination of both in vitro and in vivo approaches, he is working to understand the mechanisms underlying the regulation of drug transporters and drug metabolism enzymes, and its consequent influence on the disposition, therapeutic efficacy, and toxicity of medications. The long term goal of his research is to utilize these findings to improve the efficacy and safety of drug therapy." .

