    ns1:researchOverview "My research  interests are in the area of early childhood care and education and  include best practices and policy issues, inclusion of children with  special needs, diversity, bi-lingualism, classroom management, teacher  training and parent-teacher collaboration in the early childhood  setting. I am also interested in research on issues in administration  and leadership in child development facilities.<strong><br /></strong>" .

