        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n888156013> ;
    ns1:overview "Barbara Smith is a physical therapist with 15 years of acute care and cardiopulmonary clinical experience. She received her entry-level physical therapy degree from University of Pittsburgh, and an advanced Master&rsquo;s Degree in Physical Therapy from University of Florida in 1998. She returned to the Rehabilitation Science Doctorate program in 2007, and her current research focuses upon muscle fiber remodeling after respiratory overload training. Her clinical mentor is Dr. Dr. Danny Martin (Physical Therapy), and her basic science mentor is Dr. Paul Davenport (Physiological Sciences)." ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-2246" .

