        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1996104687>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n315402179>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n565517766> ;
    ns1:overview """<p>Dr. Tiwari has been American Board   Certified in Psychiatry and  Neurology (Psychiatry) since 1981. He went to MGM   Medical School at  Indore University in Indore, India. He attended University of   Ottawa  in Ontario, Canada to complete his Residency in Psychiatry. He conducted    his Neurology Residency at University of Ottawa as well as Dallhousie    University, St. John, NB, Canada and at the University of Health  Sciences in   Chicago, Illinois.</p>\r
<p>After many years of private practice   as a Neurologist and  Psychiatrist, Dr. Tiwari traveled overseas, working in New   Zealand and  various locations in Florida. His travels provided a wealth of   useful  experience working with both adults and children in different settings    and in different healthcare systems.</p>""" .

