    ns1:researchOverview "Although my research activities have spanned a wide range of tropical ornamental crops from<br />tropical foliage plant production, tropical cut flower production, palm horticulture, containergrown<br />woody ornamental plant production, and landscape production, my current research is<br />focused on mineral nutrition and fertilization of palms and other ornamental plants in the<br />landscape" .

