        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n708125291> ;
    ns1:overview "Debra has 32 years of experience in physical therapy in a variety of settings        and has been on the UF Faculty at Tacachale for 3 years. Previously, she        taught therapeutic exercise for 8 years as a Clinical Instructor at UF and        was a consultant to the UF Swim Team. She has had extensive experience in        Proprioceptive Neuromusclular Facilitation, teaching numerous courses throughout        the US and contributed pully photographs to the 3 rd edition of Proprioceptive        Neuromuscular Facilitation." .

