    ns1:overview "Dr. Doty is currently Faculty Associate for the Center for Research on Women's Health (now called the Women's Health Research Center); The Brain Institute, the Center for Neuropsychological Studies, the Center for Gerontological Studies/Institute for Gerontology at the University of Florida, the Department of Clinical and Health Psychology, the Department of Occupational Therapy; and the Geriatric Research, Education &amp; Clinical Center (GRECC) at the Malcom Randall Veteran Affairs Medical Center. In addition, she is the Administrator of the University of Florida Cognitive and Memory Disorder Clinics (partially funded by the Florida Department of Elder Affairs Alzheimer&rsquo;s Disease Initiative)." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "dotyl@neurology.ufl.edu" ;
