    ns1:outreachOverview """<ul>\r
<li>Blackboard Migration</li>\r
<li>Clinical Trials Online Training, Health Science Center</li>\r
<li>College of Medicine Digital Capture of Classroom Lectures</li>\r
<li>Electronic Individualized Education Plan Implementation, District Wide, Volusia County</li>\r
<li>Groupwise Implementation</li>\r
<li>HSC Security Program for Information Computing </li>\r
<li>myUfl Portal (PeopleSoft) Implementation and Planning</li>\r
<li>Training Registration and Tracking System</li>\r
</ul>""" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-5018" ;
    ns1:researchOverview """<p>Expertise in qualitative analysis and in using NVIVO, a qualitative software program. Experienced in working with multidisciplinary research teams and guiding faculty with diverse backgrounds into the scholarship of teaching and learning within their discipline.</p>\r
Recent Work<br />Faculty, Student and Staff perceptions of online teaching tools<br />Faculty perceptions of faculty development programs<br />Effectiveness of electronic lecture capture in a college of medicine<br /><br />Research Topics: Questions and Directions<br />Faculty Input &ndash; what directions can the input of faculty provide with regards to the use of teaching with technology?<br />Faculty Development &ndash; what elements of faculty development can impact successful teaching?<br />Faculty and Administration &ndash; how can the diverse relationships between faculty and administration impact campus life?<br />Cross Disciplinary Peer Relationship &ndash; what factors encourage cross disciplinary peer relationships?<br />""" .

