    ns1:overview "Dr. Knapp is an applied economist whose areas of specialization include examining the quality of care and expenditure patterns for children and adolescents in vulnerable populations. Specifically, Dr. Knapp is investigating the association between sociodemographic factors and expenditures for children with life-limiting conditions" .

