    ns1:researchOverview "My research program at the University of Florida includes physiological studies to enhance production and post-harvest quality of flowering potted plants and fresh cut flowers. The floriculture post-harvest program was established in 1983 and the laboratory is now the the largest lab serving this scientific area in the United States." .

