    ns1:researchOverview "My research interests all fall under the umbrella of marketing of user services, but specifically relate to 1) assessment of how users seek information and their needs in relation to library services and 2) creation, promotion, and distribution of customized services that support users in their research and teaching endeavors.  The focus is on user populations in the academic sciences and health sciences arenas" .

