    ns1:overview """<p>Dr. Dolan is the current dean of the University of Florida College of Dentistry. In May 2003 she was promoted from interim dean to the new dean of the college.<sup><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teresa_A._Dolan#cite_note-0"></a></sup></p>\r
<p>Dr. Dolan first came to the University of Florida in 1989 to begin her career as an assistant professor. In 1996, she was  appointed to the position of associate dean for academic affairs at the  UF College of Dentistry. Her primary interest is geriatric dentistry,  geriatric dental education, and doing research pertaining to indigent or  elderly patients.</p>""" .

