    ns1:researchOverview "My research program emphasizes water quality (mainly animal-related problems) and land application of solid wastes. Most of my research is interdisciplinary and is done in cooperation with colleagues in such disciplines as animal science, hydrology, wildlife, agricultural engineering, and horticultural science." .

