    ns1:researchOverview "My research focuses on past climate changes, primarily in the American  tropics, over the past 10,000 years.&nbsp; My main archive of paleoclimatic  information is shells from lake sediments.&nbsp; One of my specialties is the  collection of undisturbed sediment cores from lakes and other bodies of  water." .

