    ns1:overview "The Clinical and Translation Science Institute (CTSI) at the University of Florida will fundamentally change the ability to coordinate biomedical research with clinical applications. It will leverage existing strengths and remove barriers to the pace and growth of research. The collaboration provides unique opportunities for expansion across the spectrum of human investigation, and sets the stage for major advances in human health. It is focused on building bridges between many previously disparate entities across Florida.The Clinical and Translation Science Institute (CTSI) at the University of Florida will fundamentally change the ability to coordinate biomedical research with clinical applications. It will leverage existing strengths and remove barriers to the pace and growth of research. The collaboration provides unique opportunities for expansion across the spectrum of human investigation, and sets the stage for major advances in human health. It is focused on building bridges between many previously disparate entities across Florida." ;
