    ns1:overview "Nam H. Dang, MD, PhD is a  board certified medical oncologist with  expertise in the study and treatment of  lymphoma and chronic  lymphocytic leukemia (CLL).&nbsp; He is Professor and Deputy Chief of the   Division of Hematology &amp; Oncology as well as Director of the  University of  Florida Shands Cancer Center Clinical Trials Office.&nbsp;" ;
