    ns1:overview "Asseng comes to Florida from his work as Science Coordinator of the Western Australia's Climate Adaptation Program, a multi-million dollar research program which coordinates the activities of researchers at the University of Western Australia (Perth), Murdoch University (Perth), Curtin University (Perth), the Western Australian Department of Agriculture and Food, and the Australia's national science agency, the Commonwealth Scientific and Industrial Research Organization (CSIRO)." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "sasseng@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-1864 ext. 224" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Research activities include the integration of bio-physical and human behaviour approaches in multi-agent based models to study emerging behaviour in human-agricultural landscape systems." .

