    ns1:overview "Dr. Treloar is ANA certified as a Family Nurse  Practitioner, and her major area of practice is in Infectious Diseases  and specifically in the area of STDs. Her current clinical practice is  primarily in the area of HIV/AIDS in rural north central Florida  counties." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Treloar is currently the principal investigator for a pilot study titled <i>Internet Support Group for Rural Minority Women with HIV</i> funded by the Biobehavioral Research Center in the College of Nursing" .

