    ns1:researchOverview "My research interests are to identify the genetic components controlling agronomically and<br /> economically important traits of biofuel and field crops for targeted genetic improvement of productivity and stress tolerance. The integration of functional and translational genomics, bioinformatics, genetics, and plant breeding will enable genomics informed breeding and accelerate crop improvement." .

