    ns1:overview "Dr. Grosbach brings years  of experience in treating multiple hematology  and oncology conditions to the  University of Florida Shands Hospital.&nbsp;   He has a strong reputation for treating breast cancer, lung cancer,  and  colorectal cancer patients as well as various hematologic  disorders.&nbsp; Dr. Grosbach&rsquo;s congeniality draws loyal  patients to his  current practice." ;
