        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n992344837> ;
    ns1:overview "Dr. Cunningham received his dental degree from  Marquette University in  1957 and his Endodontic Certificate from the Naval Graduate Dental  School in Bethesda, Maryland in 1965. Following completion of his Navy  career in 1977, he was an Associate Professor in Endodontics at the  University of  Kentucky College of Dentistry. In 1991 he joined the  University of Florida College of Dentistry Endodontic Department as a  Professor of Endodontics until 1996. At present, he is a Visiting  Professor in the Endodontic Department. He has served as President of  the American Association of Endodontists and The American Board of  Endodontics." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "eaglefl@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-5438" .

