    ns1:researchOverview "My primary areas of interest are diseases of free-ranging wildlife and conservation.  I work intensively with marine turtles as a contract veterinarian in the Office of Protected Resources (National Marine Fisheries Service).   Other species of interest include marine mammals, crocodilians, other reptiles, and amphibians." .

