    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Sand's research interests include shelf life predictions for milk, juice, tea in various aseptic environments and packaging materials, processes toward the determination of optimal active learning in on-line teaching methods for undergraduates, strategic role of packaging in the KSA, applicability of advanced food processing and packaging techniques to address low and high acid and low water activity liquids, and shelf life prediction of nuts and snack foods as a function of lipid profile and packaging." .

