    ns1:researchOverview "My research interests include the assessment of students with learning disabilities, particularly related to difficulties in reading. Furthermore, my research has focused on Curriculum-Based Measurement, the Response to Intervention model of service delivery in the schools, and reading instruction and interventions for students struggling to learn to read" .

