    ns1:overview "Dr. Jessup teaches pharmacology to undergraduate and graduate students as well as adult health to undergraduate students. He holds membership in Sigma Theta Tau  International, Florida Nurses Association, Southern Nursing Research  Society, and the American College of Sports Medicine. He has volunteered  services in Haiti." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Jessup&rsquo;s research focus includes the e ffects of  exercise on renal function, cardiovascular function, oxidative stress,  ambulatory blood pressure, bone density and balance in the elderly." .

