    ns1:overview "Biology has always been an interest for me from childhood. I developed interest in ecology during my undergraduate studies at University of St. Thomas as a result of coursework and research projects. In particular, my research focused on the effects of predicted climate change and distribution of the Asian tiger mosquito." ;
