        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n534545986> ;
    ns1:overview "Clinical Associate Professor of Anesthesiology at the University of  Florida; did residency then fellowship in Cardiothoracic anesthesia, and  then has been a staff member since 2000. Currently I am also the  Director of the Master of Education Fellowship from the C.O.M., and  responsible for the Difficult Airway Rotation and Airway Management  Services at the NFSGVHS. My interests include: 1-Airway related topics 2-Education about Airway management 3- Resident  training in Airway management 4-Non-Anesthesia providers airway training  and education 5-Education in general and specifically technology in  education." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "Furdaneta@anest.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 374-6051" .

