        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n297221> ;
    ns1:overview "Dr. Mohseni has six years of experience in geotechnical engineering. Her geotechnical experience includes slope stability, seepage and consolidation analyses for embankment dams, liquefaction analyses, and filter design. Civil design experience includes embankment dam design and shallow and deep foundation design. She also has some experience with rock mechanics and tunneling. Ms. Mohseni specializes in modeling using the Geo-Studio suite of software and FSConsol and has knowledge of Plaxis and fracture mechanics modeling using FRANC2D." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "amohseni@ce.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-9537" .

