    ns1:overview "After completing General Adult Psychiatry residency at the School of  Medicine, University of Connecticut, Dr. Korah pursued fellowship in Geriatric  psychiatry at the Geriatric Institute of Psychiatry, Weill Medical College of  Cornell University, NY. She then joined the Faculty of Well Medical College of  Cornell University, NY and worked as an Attending Psychiatrist at the New York  Presbyterian Hospital, NY, prior to joining the Department of Psychiatry, COM at  UF. Dr. Korah is a Diplomate of ABPN in both General Adult Psychiatry and  Geriatric Psychiatry." ;
