    ns1:overview "Professor Keith E. Muller leads the design and analysis of health outcomes and policy research studies. NIH funding for collaborations across the Health Science Center comes from NIDCR, NHLBI, NIAAA, NIDDK, and NIDA. He serves as the Head of the Statistics and Data Core, as well as Assoc. Dir. for the SE Center for Research to Reduce Disparities in Oral Health. His journal publications split roughly equally between scientific collaborations and biostatistical methodology developments. He has coauthored three current books on the theory and practice of linear models.<br />" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 294-5957" .

