    ns1:researchOverview "Current research is focused on: (1) environmental physiology of ornamental plants with an emphasis on light, temperature, substrate, water, nutrients, and plant growth regulators influencing plant propagation, production, and interior performance; (2) sustainable approaches for controlling invasive species; and (3) somatic cell genetics and its application for producing genetic variation and for developing new cultivars.<br />" .

