    ns1:overview "Sora Kim was previously an assistant professor in the College of Communication at DePaul University in Chicago. She also has professional experience in the advertising and public relations fields. She has taught public relations principles, crisis communication management, international public relations, public relations management, research methods for the communication professional, and campaigns for both undergraduate and graduate students" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "sorakim@jou.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-9961" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "How different corporate communication&nbsp;strategies (CSR,&nbsp;Corporate ability, and Hybrid strategies) can influence consumers&rsquo; evaluations of companies and their products" .

