        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n950935991> ;
    ns1:overview "In 1972, McKenzie joined the UF College of pharmacy and assumed clinical  pharmacy responsibilities in the Pediatric Department of Shands  Teaching Hospital. In 1984, he was appointed as Assistant Dean for  Student Affairs responsible for recruitment, pre-pharmacy counseling,  financial aid, awards, academic performance, registration, examination  scheduling, classroom scheduling, and faculty advisement. In 1989, he  was promoted to Professor of Pharmacy in the Department of  Pharmacotherapy and Translational Research and as Associate Dean for  Student Affairs. In 2005, he was promoted to Senior Associate Dean for  Professional Affairs." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "mckenzie@cop.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-6221" .

