    ns1:overview "Carrie&nbsp;Harmon&rsquo;s research and  extension&nbsp;programs center around needs  identified by interactions  with&nbsp;extension faculty and  commodity-specific clientele groups through the  Plant Disease Clinic,  extension activities and the National Plant Diagnostic  Network (NPDN).&nbsp;  The&nbsp;NPDN is a USDA-CSREES cooperative project.&nbsp;  Carrie is the Director  of the UF Plant Disease Clinic, which is the hub  laboratory of the  SPDN." ;
