    ns1:overview "Dr. Demetree is the Assistant Director of Emergency and Consult/Liaison Education. She is Board Certified in Adult Psychiatry. Though she is not boarded in Child and Adolescent Psychiatry, she has extensive training in adolescent psychopathology and the management of comorbid medical illnesses. She works with the Child and Adolescent Psychiatry fellows while they are on the Child Psychiatry Consultation-Liaison Services.<br /><br />Dr. Demetree&rsquo;s other areas of interest are medical student education. She has served as a small group leader, and also directs the undergraduate student physician shadowing program. This program has seen quite a bit of recent renewed and enhanced interests under her new leadership." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "demetree@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(407) 262-2200" .

