    ns1:researchOverview """<p>Dr.McLamore's ongoing interdisciplinary research includes development of sensors and biosensors for supporting agricultural and environmental research.&nbsp; We focus on improving sensor performance by immobilizing nanomaterials and biological materials.&nbsp; Current research includes bioregenerative water recovery systems, bioenergy production, and the effects of climate change on plant physiology.</p>\r
<p>&nbsp;</p>""" .

