        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n971952086> ;
    ns1:overview "Hall joined the University of Florida Faculty full-time as Clinical  Assistant Professor in June 2010. She serves as one of three supervising  faculty for the UF Medication Therapy Management (MTM) Call Center. The  MTM Call Center provides MTM services to Wellcare Medicare Part D  members including comprehensive medication reviews (CMR), physician  consultation and member follow up. MTM faculty precept third and fourth  year pharmacy students and pharmacy residents assigned to the MTM Call  Center. Hall earned her Doctor of Pharmacy degree from the University of  Florida College of Pharmacy in 2005. After graduation, Hall moved to  Virginia Beach, VA and worked in the community retail pharmacy setting  for a short time while her husband completed his service in the United  States Navy. In 2008 she became Director of Pharmacy at Select Specialty  Hospital, a long-term acute care hospital in Gainesville, FL. She has  previously served as Clinical Assistant Professor for Adult Medicine  Advanced Pharmacy Practice Experience and Hospital Pharmacy Practicum  Preceptor for University of Florida College of Pharmacy Students at  Select Specialty Hospital Gainesville, FL." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "ahall@cop.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-9693" .

