    ns1:overview "This research program focuses on the development of new cultivars for the&nbsp; Florida environmental horticulture industry and to satisfy the need of plant materials for Florida-friendly landscaping. Florida&rsquo;s environmental horticulture industry is a very important contributor to the state&rsquo;s economy, employment, and rural development. Florida&nbsp; growers in this dynamic industry and&nbsp; Florida&nbsp; consumers face severe challenges including devastating diseases, temperature stresses, and biological invasiveness." ;
