        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n548802630> ;
    ns1:overview "Dr. Vance Whitaker&rsquo;s research program in strawberry breeding and genetics develops cultivars for the Florida strawberry industry that possess desirable yield patterns, flavor, postharvest quality, disease resistance and other traits.&nbsp; Cultivar development is enhanced by genetic characterization of traits and through collaborative research with a statewide team of University of Florida researchers in the areas of genomics, pathology, production, and postharvest.&nbsp; Dr. Whitaker&rsquo;s extension program involves the training of extension agents as well as on-farm trials of advanced selections, field days, and newsletter articles." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "vwhitaker@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(813) 633-4136" .

