        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n904976434> ;
    ns1:overview "Dr. Gregg currently teaches graduate courses in Health  Policy &amp; Finance and Ethics, and an undergraduate course in  Leadership &amp; Management. All are Web-based courses. She currently serves as President of the Florida  Nurses Association, Chair of the Legislative Committee for SREB-CCEN  (Southern Regional Education Board-Council on Collegiate Education for  Nursing), Chair of the American Nurses Association (ANA) Constituent  Assembly, and serves as a non-voting member of the ANA governing Board  of Directors. She was a governor appointee to the inaugural board of the  Florida Center for Nursing, where she also served as Board Chair. She  is a long term member of Sigma Theta Tau International." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "greggac@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(904) 244-5172" .

