    ns1:overview "Dr. Salazar&rsquo;s clinical practice area is Midwifery and  Women&rsquo;s Health. Prior to teaching in the College of Nursing, Dr. Salazar  spent seven years in Orlando, Florida in an advanced practice role in a  full scope OB/GYN practice. She has eight years experience as a staff  RN with Shands at UF." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Salazar has research interests in preventive health for vulnerable populations." .

