    ns1:researchOverview "My research is focused on applying state-of-the-art geochemical  techniques to resolve current Earth and Environmental Sciences problems.  In particular, I work on relationships between magmatism and  ore-deposit formation, submarine hydrothermal process, trace-element and  isotopic compositions of environmental samples, human teeth and bones  with implications for ancient human origins and current environmental  problems, and laser-ablation U-Pb and Hf isotope analyses." .

