    ns1:overview "Professor Reppenhagen teaches accounting information systems and strategic costing in the undergraduate and graduate curriculum. His research interests are in areas that explore the institutions of financial accounting including how norms and conventions influence financial reporting and how that differs from formal regulation. His research has been published in the Review of Accounting Studies journal and presented at various invited university seminars and conferences." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "davidr@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-0223" .

