        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n733168370> ;
    ns1:overview "Professor Bradley teaches clinical and didactic courses  for undergraduate students in adult health nursing. She also teaches in  the Accelerated Batchelor&rsquo;s to Master&rsquo;s Program. Prior to teaching at  the University of Florida, Professor Bradley taught medical surgical  nursing, critical care nursing, and leadership in North Carolina. Professor Bradley serves as chair of the Faculty Affairs  Committee, is a member of the Leadership Council and the Search  Committee. Professor Bradley holds membership in the Florida Nurses  Association, Sigma Theta Tau International, and the American Association  of Critical Care Nurses. She has also been involved with the Nursing  Internship Project with Shands at Alachua General Hospital for the past  two years." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "sbradley@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-6436" .

