    ns1:overview "Dr. AJ Layon is the Chief of the Division, a Diplomate of the American  Board of Anesthesiology (1988), and holds a certificate of special  qualifications in Critical Care Medicine (1989). Dr. Layon is also a  Diplomate in the American Board of Internal Medicine (1984). He  completed his Fellowship in Critical Care Medicine at the University of  Florida in 1984. Dr. Layon has previously directed the Emergency Room at  Shands Hospital at the University of Florida, and is currently the  Medical Director for the City of Gainesville&rsquo;s Fire Rescue Service. He  has also been a member of the Critical Care Medicine faculty since 1984.  His special interests include burn therapy, sepsis, ethics, and  outcomes research." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "layon@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 733-0940" .

