    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Kennedy's research centers on underserved public school  students who do not demonstrate traditionally defined academic and  social success. Her broader research interests include alternative  education; assessment and evaluation; policy implementation; early  adolescence and middle grades education; alienation and resilience;  philosophy of education; and qualitative research methods." .

