    ns1:overview "Dr. Schaub is an Association of Energy Engineers certified energy manager (CEM), an American Society for Quality certified quality engineer and manager (CQE and CQM) and a Six Sigma Black Belt. Besides her Ph.D. in Industrial Engineering from Arizona State University, she has a Masters of Science in Business Administration from Indiana University Northwest and a Bachelors of Science in Metallurgical Engineering from the University of Pittsburgh." .

