    ns1:overview "Professor Esenwein served as the Associate Chair to the      department of history from 1995-1999. His recent courses include: Readings      in Mediterranean History, Modern European Revolutions, Modern European Ideologies,      Europe Since 1914, Cold War in Europe, and Second World War in Europe." ;
