    ns1:researchOverview "Topical: Settlement and subsistence patterns; early agricultural economies; preindustrial urbanism; pre-Hispanic architecture; pre-Hispanic irrigation and water management technology; Colonial Period and Spanish contact settlements; GIS/Remote Sensing; Quaternary geomorphology, climatology and tectonics.<br />Area Interests:Peru, Bolivia, Chile, South America, the Caribbean, Florida &amp; Southeast Gulf Coast." .

