    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Katherine Gray received her Doctor of Audiology (Au.D.) from the  University of Florida in Gainesville, FL. Dr. Gray's specialties include  the assessment and evaluation of hearing in infants, children, and  adults with an emphasis in cochlear implant evaluation, programming and  rehabilitation; neonatal hearing evaluation and follow-up; pediatric  audiology; and auditory rehabilitation." .

