    ns1:overview "Professor Nicolo Omenetto interest is in analytical chemistry and he is the editor of Spectrochimica Acta Part B-Atomic Spectroscopy." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "omenetto@chem.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-9853" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Our research is focused on the use of lasers on atomic and molecular systems. Our analytical goal is the development of novel methods of analysis, or the improvement of the selectivity and the sensitivity of the existing ones." .

