    ns1:overview "Guanghui (George) Lan joined the ISE department at the University of Florida in Fall, 2009, after receiving his Ph.D. in Industrial &amp; Systems Engineering from Georgia Institute of Technology in August 2009. Dr. Lan&rsquo;s research interests lie in theory, algorithms and applications of convex programming and stochastic optimization." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "glan@ise.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-1464" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Most of his current research concerns the design of efficient algorithms with strong theoretical performance guarantees for solving challenging optimization problems. He is also developing some interests in the modeling and computational aspects of Bio-fuel engineering, through the collaboration with Dr. Tong from the ABE department.<br />" .

