    ns1:overview "Miho Bautista is a researcher, educator, and clinician. She came to the US in 1988 from Japan from a culture that holds the elderly in high esteem and has great respect for their experience and wisdom. Dr. Bautista found she wanted to oversee and supervise every aspect of care of older patients in an interdisciplinary setting." .

