    ns1:overview "Sandra Chance is the Executive Director of the Brechner Center for Freedom of Information at the University of Florida. She is the McClatchy Professor in Freedom of Information and Professor of Journalism in the College of Journalism and Communications. She teaches media law at both the undergraduate and graduate level. Before entering the practice of law, Chance held a variety of positions in the journalism and communications field<br />" ;
