    ns1:researchOverview "Our major research focus is the conservation and management of terrestrial vertebrates in and around human altered landscapes. We are interested in working with threatened and endangered populations and examining the influences of urbanization, agriculture, and intensive recreational land uses on community structure, population dynamics, behaviors, and the evolution of mammals." .

