        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n840318598> ;
    ns1:overview "<p>Roane joined the faculty of the University of Florida College of  Pharmacy in March 2010 as a Clinical Assistant Professor in the  Medication Therapy Management (MTM) Call Center. She began her career in  pharmacy in 1988 working as a pharmacy technician, becoming a certified  pharmacy technician in 2000. She graduated from the University of  Florida with her Doctor of Pharmacy degree in 2006. Prior to joining the  University of Florida, Roane worked as a clinical pharmacist at AvMed  Health Plans in Gainesville, FL. While at AvMed, she worked as the lead  pharmacist for the MTM program, provided direct oversight of the  utilization management program, served as resource for internal and  external healthcare professionals, and also served as a preceptor for  3rd and 4th year UF PharmD clerkship students. She continues to work  occasionally as a relief pharmacist at a small independent community  pharmacy with locations in Alachua and Newberry, FL. In her spare time  she enjoys spending time with her family and friends, playing  volleyball, and reading.</p>" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "troane@cop.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-9692" .

