    ns1:overview "<p>Professor Chappell has been a clinical instructor for the past 7 years at the Malcolm Randall Veterans Affairs Medical Center on both medical and surgical units with the generic BSN program. Professor Chappell continues to serve as  Public Relation/Community events coordinator for North Central Florida  Advanced Practice Nurses group coordinating health promotion, first aid,  and blood pressure screenings at several local events over each  calendar year.</p>" ;
