    ns1:overview "Cliff Lamb is a native of Zimbabwe, Africa, where he was reared on a livestock operation devoted to cattle. Lamb is a professor in the Department of Animal Science at the University of Florida, located at the North Florida Research and Education Center in Marianna. He is author of more than 40 refereed journal articles, 2 chapters in texts, and more than 100 presentations and articles in other scientific and popular press." ;
