    ns1:overview "David Pharies is the Associate Dean for Humanities, College of Liberal Arts and Sciences at the University of Florida in Gainesville. Among his most important publications are Diccionario etimologico de los sufijos espanoles [Etymological Dictionary of Spanish Suffixes] (Madrid: Gredos, 2002), University of Chicago Spanish Dictionary, fifth edition.<br />" ;
