    ns1:overview "Professor McCrea has held fellowships from the American Council of Learned Societies, the National Endowment for the Humanities, and the American Society for 18th-Century Studies. He is presently at work on a book dealing with the legal backgrounds for 18th-century novels, particularly the rights of orphan heiresses. McCrea has been at UF since 1976." .

