    ns1:overview "Beck served as a professor at Auburn University between 1979 and 2004.&nbsp;  She now serves as Professor Emerita with Auburn University Harrison  School of Pharmacy.&nbsp; Her professional practice experiences have included  providing pharmacy consultations in a pediatric neurology clinic,  leading a Pharmacokinetic Consultation Service at two medical centers.&nbsp;  Beck has fulfilled a variety of administrative responsibilities  including Director of&nbsp; Educational Initiatives, Director of the Office  of Experiential Learning, Director of the Post-BS Pharm.D. program, and  &nbsp;Outcomes Assessment Leader." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "beck@cop.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-6226" .

