    ns1:overview "<p>Dr. George is a clinical investigator and educator with a focus on gastrointestinal malignancies.&nbsp; He is board certified in Medical Oncology, Hematology, and Internal Medicine.&nbsp; He is a member of the medical honor society Alpha Omega Alpha, the American Society of Clinical Oncology, and numerous clinical trial cooperative groups.</p>" ;
