    ns1:overview "Dr. Friedman is the author of more than 250 articles and book chapters and has written a book on radiosurgery. He is a member of numerous professional organizations. Most notably, he is a Past-President of the Congress of Neurological Surgeons, Past President of the Florida Neurosurgical Society, and Past President of the International Stereotactic Radiosurgery Society. He is the Past Editor of Neurosurgery On Call, the Internet homepage of organized neurosurgery. He is a member of the Shands Hospital Board of Directors." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "friedman@neurosurgery.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-9000" .

