    ns1:researchOverview "Conduct applied research on forage systems using warm-season/cool-season forages for livestock production and nutrient management (traditional and new landowners). Interest has been in the area of grazing management (grazing intensity and animal performance), forage quality, forage physiology and environmental factors affecting forage production. Upcoming studies will include alternative uses such as bio-fuels." .

