    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Citty&rsquo;s  research has focused on methods to improve nursing care and patient  outcomes; specifically focusing on evidence based nursing practices and  systems redesign strategies to improve patient care.&nbsp; Dr.  Citty&rsquo;s doctoral dissertation focused on an innovative use of  ambulatory blood pressure monitoring in hypertensive patients to  determine if they could become more aware of their blood pressure  patterns." .

