    ns1:overview "Our research deals with theoretical and computational aspects of molecular and materials sciences, with emphasis on the unified treatment of physical and chemical kinetics using quantum molecular dynamics." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "micha@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-6977" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Our aim is to provide a fundamental approach to molecular dynamics, where electronic and nuclear motions are consistently coupled to account for quantal effects. We use quantum and statistical mechanics, mathematical, and computational methods, to describe time-dependent phenomena (such as femtosecond dynamics and spectra) in both simple and complex molecular systems." .

