    ns1:overview "Dr. Knapp started at the University of Florida College of Nursing August 2009. She is a member of the American Nurses Association, the Florida  Nurses Association, the American Association of Critical Care Nurses,  the Southern Nursing Research Society and Sigma Theta Tau. She also  serves as Secretary, for Alpha Theta Chapter, Sigma Theta Tau." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Knapp conducted research in 2007 on <i>Parental Perceptions of the NICU Experience</i>. In 2009 she researched the <i>Effects of an Evidence-Based Intervention on Stress and Coping of Family Members of Critically Ill Trauma Patients.</i>" .

