    ns1:overview "Barbara J. Bour is a Clinical Lecturer in the department of Physical              Therapy. She has over 30 years of clinical experience with a primary              emphasis in pediatrics. She has been assisting in the pediatric class              at the University of Florida Physical Therapy department as adjunct              faculty since 1999. She assisted with the design of the clinical aspect              of the course curriculum. She has taught and participated in medical              missions in the United States, Central and South America and the South              Pacific. Her current project is to develop a collaborative project              with UF Physical Therapy department and Shands Rehab working with              radiation oncology patients at the Davis Cancer Center. In that process,              she will participate in the implementation of a grant funded to investigate              the rehabilitation of the patient undergoing radiation and oncology." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "bourb@phhp.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-6434" .

