    ns1:overview "As an Internist and Geriatrician with interests in the impact of pharmacology and physical activity on multiple outcomes in older adults, I will provide additional perspective for the design of analyses, manuscript proposals and ancillary studies in the WHI cohort for the 2010-15 extension. I will provide oversight of junior investigators and will participate in Southeast Regional Center activities involving review and analysis of the existing and future elements of the extensive WHI dataset. I am particularly interested in participating in ancillary studies and physical assessment of the older WHI cohort." ;
