    ns1:researchOverview "I am a professor of education  and director of the School of Teaching and Learning. With a background  in science education, my interests include the study of science teacher  learning and change.&nbsp;I am particularly interested in teacher  professional development programs and the development of  reform-oriented, subject-specific pedagogical knowledge and practice for  science learning and scientific inquiry." .

