    ns1:overview "Dr. Kelly is an internationally recognized authority on public relations and fundraising. She is the author of two award-winning books and more than 70 articles, book chapters, monographs, and refereed papers.&nbsp; Her teaching areas include public relations principles, strategy, campaign management, public relations foundations, fundraising, and philanthropy. Dr. Kelly has 17 years of professional experience as a fundraiser and public relations practitioner." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "kskelly@jou.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-9359" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Her research interests focus on organization-public relationships, particularly donor relations." .

