    ns1:overview "<p>Professor Schwait teaches undergraduate courses and  graduate level courses for the Psychiatric/Mental Health (PMHNP) track.&nbsp;  She also teaches&nbsp;the PMHNP role in the clinical practice setting, and serves as a  clinical preceptor for students. Professor Schwait is an active member of  the American Nurses Association, American Psychiatric Nurses  Association, and National Association of Rural Mental Health.</p>" ;
