    ns1:overview "Dr. W. David Wei joined the University of Florida in August, 2009 as an Assistant Professor working in Analytical, Physical, and Materials Chemistry with research interests in novel electronic and optical properties of metallic and semiconductor nanomaterials and their applications in solar energy harvesting, conversion and storage, visible light photocatalysis, chemical and biological detection, drug delivery, and cancer therapeutics." ;
