    ns1:overview "Dr. Markham is a hematologist-oncologist with a focus on  lymphoproliferative disorders -- including non-Hodgkin&rsquo;s and Hodgkins  lymphoma &ndash; and gynecologic malignancies. She serves as the co-founder  and medical director of the adult Cancer Survivor Program at the  University of Florida Shands Cancer Center. She is board certified in  Internal Medicine as well as board certified in both hematology and  oncology. She is a member of the American Society of Clinical Oncology  (ASCO), the American Society of Hematology (ASH), and the American  College of Physicians (ACP)." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "merry.markham@medicine.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-7832" .

