    ns1:overview "Christina Overstreet is a senior lecturer in the Department of Germanic and Slavic Studies.&nbsp; She received her Ph.D. in the College of Education at the University of Florida in the spring 2006.&nbsp; Presently, she teaches <i>Discover German</i>, an online sequence she has developed and implemented together with colleagues in her department.&nbsp;" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "overstre@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-3787" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Her research interests include reading authentic text in the hypermedia environment, reading comprehension assessment, and intercultural communication." .

