    ns1:overview "Steven N. Roper, MD, currently serves as the surgical director of the University of Florida Comprehensive Epilepsy Program and has performed over 1,000 surgeries for the treatment of epilepsy. He is also the surgical director of the University of Florida Neuroendocrine Program and frequently performs surgeries for pituitary tumors using minimally invasive approaches." ;
