    ns1:overview "Michael F. Waters, M.D., Ph.D. is Director of the Stroke Program in the Department of Neurology at the University of Florida & Shands Hospital. He directs the acute stroke team helping to ensure that Shands remains at the forefront of acute stroke care. With other members of the stroke team, he directs the implementation of the American Stroke Association's Get with the Guidelines national stroke database and quality assurance program and serves as site principal investigator for clinical trials designed to improve clinical outcomes in stroke." ;
