    ns1:researchOverview "For  the past five years, my research focused on assessing the cost of  special education teacher education and estimating its cost  effectiveness. In addition to cost, judgments of cost effectiveness  required estimates of graduates&rsquo; competence, how long they remain in the  field, and the extent to which programs contribute uniquely to the  supply of beginning teachers. More recently, I am a member of an NCIPP  writing team conducting an analysis of induction and mentoring policy  with a particular focus on special education. <br />" .

