    ns1:researchOverview "My research focuses on various issues related to statistics and mathematics teacher education. My current  research involves teachers&rsquo; preparation to teach statistics, assessment  of statistical concepts, and the examination of effective methods to  impart change in preservice teachers&rsquo; content knowledge, pedagogical  content knowledge, and dispositions through the use of field experiences  in poverty settings." .

