        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n973295397> ;
    ns1:overview "<p>Jodi Oren earned her BS in Physical Therapy from Boston University in 1973,        and an Advanced Masters with specialty in Developmental Disabilities from        New York University in 1985. Her background is in pediatrics, where she has worked in settings as varied        as home health, acute care, school programs, early intervention programs,        and rehabilitation. Coming to Gainesville and working at Tacachale has provided        her with a wonderful opportunity to see the life span effects of developmental        disabilities and learn more about adult medicine.</p>" .

