    ns1:overview "He is recognized as an  outstanding clinician-educator in the Division  of Hematology/Oncology and the  Department of Medicine.&nbsp; &nbsp;He holds  various medical directorships.&nbsp; He is chairman of the Shands Hospital   Transfusion Committee.&nbsp; He is noted as a  key clinical faculty member in  the Internal Medicine residency training program  and the Division of  Hematology/Oncology Fellowship Program." ;
