    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Collins' research emphasis is on environmental pedology investigating the  relationship of soils to landscape, vegetation, and hydrology as well as  interpretation of land use; exploring near coast subaqueous soils;  modeling of ground-penetrating radar (GPR) data to analysis subsurface  variability; and detecting pedological-human interactions to study the  genesis of soils. <br />" .

