    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Thorn's general research area is the theory of elementary particles. His primary focus is on strong interactions and efforts to understand the fundamental forces (EM, weak, strong, gravity) within a single unified theory. He has devoted most of his energy to develop string theory as a unifying concept and QCD, the gauge theory of strong interactions." .

