    ns1:researchOverview "Biological transformations of substituted aromatic and aliphatic compounds; molecular-level fundamentals of microbial transformation processes, including mechanistic studies of enzymatic oxidation of aromatic compounds by soluble methane monooxygenase and quantitative structure-activity relationships; bioremediation of substituted aromatic and aliphatic compounds; microbial ecology of mixed cultures with emphasis on rhizodegradation" .

