    ns1:overview "At UF, I teach courses covering nineteenth-century American history, political economy, and America&rsquo;s Industrial Revolution.&nbsp; I just published a book on the early coal industry in Virginia and Pennsylvania and I&rsquo;m at work on a new study of heat and energy in the Early Republic as well as a project on economic development in nineteenth-century Florida." ;
