    ns1:researchOverview "Her training and research interests include chronic disease epidemiology among older adults, disability epidemiology, and outcomes research in rehabilitation and disability. Dr. Andresen has special expertise in research methods and measures in research related to older adults and groups with disability, including psychometric testing and refinement of health related quality of life and disability instruments." .

