    ns1:overview "James A. Shepperd is a Professor of Social Psychology at the University of Florida in Gainesville." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "shepperd@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-2165" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "My research expertise is in the area of Self and Self-processes. I am particularly interested in people&rsquo;s expectations about the future and how expectations persevere and change in the face of challenging information. I also explore how people respond when they receive challenging information." .

