    ns1:overview "Schnadelbach, Professor of Landscape Architecture, College of Design, Construction and Planning, University of Florida was principal of several Schnadelbach firms from 1969 until 1995 with offices in New York and Paris. He has had major commissions throughout the United States, Europe, South East Asia and the Middle East. He has consulted in London, Paris, Rome, Athens and Berlin to governments, institutions, and private industry. <br />" .

