    ns1:overview "Professor Curtis is a Pediatric Nurse Practitioner with  practice at Archer Family Health Care. She has expertise in acute and  critical care pediatrics and is actively involved as a certified  Mammacare specialist in the teaching and certification of Mammacare  Clinical Breast Exam and Breast Self Examination techniques.&nbsp;" .

