    ns1:overview "Professor Kohen has been practicing architecture and urban planning in the form of teaching, research and practice for the past 30 years. Her most recent teaching experience includes serving as the Professor of 5th year Studio for the past 12 years and as the Director of Academic Cooperation Affairs for the past five years at the School of Architecture at the Universidad de la Republica, Uruguay. Professor Kohen has also received appointments as Visiting Professor in various architectural schools around the world." ;
