    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Logan conducts research in the area of speech fluency and fluency disorders. His research has primarily focused upon the following areas: (a) the effect of syntactic and phonologic factors upon speech fluency, (b) methods for improving the efficiency and reliability of fluency assessments, and (c) factors that affect the ways in which typical speakers perceived people who stutter." .

