    ns1:overview "Nina Caputo is an Associate Professor in the Department of History. She received her B.A. and M.A. from the University of California, Los Angeles, and her Ph.D. from the University of California, Berkeley. Before coming to the University of Florida, she was a Mellon Postdoctoral Fellow at the University of Pennsylvania, Visiting Assistant Professor at the University of Michigan, and Assistant Professor at Florida International University." ;
