    ns1:overview "My work emphasizes design of the public realm and ways landscape architecture and urban design can be effective as community development and urban regeneration tools." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "My research is focused on designed landscapes and vernacular open space in modernizing and developed nations. Investigation of the on-going trend to build landmark public parks in mid-sized Chinese cities, Contemporary theory that examines public space, parks and gardens created as a result of colonization, so-called early modernism in China and other Asian countries, and Research on urban vernacular open spaces undesigned landscapes.<br />" .

