    ns1:researchOverview "My research focuses on the use of radiogenic isotopes (Sr, Nd, and Pb) preserved marine sediments to address questions related to paleoceanography and paleoclimatology.&nbsp; I am particularly interested in reconstructing deep ocean circulation patterns on Cenozoic time scales in order to understand the relationship between circulation and climate.&nbsp;" .

