    ns1:overview "Dr. Nair holds memberships in numerous organizations such as the  Radiological Society of North America, Society for Computer Applications  in Radiology, American Dental Association, the American Academy of Oral  and Maxillofacial Radiology, The International Association of  Dentomaxillofacial Radiology and the International Association for  Dental Research." ;
