    ns1:overview "Clayville&nbsp; joined the UF faculty in 2008. She earned a bachelor&rsquo;s in  biochemistry at Chestnut Hill College in Philadelphia, PA. She then  completed her doctorate degree in pharmacy at the University of Maryland  School of Pharmacy in 2007. Following graduation, she completed a PGY1  pharmacy practice residency in ambulatory care at Florida Hospital &ndash;  Celebration Health. After her residency, she worked as both an inpatient  and outpatient clinical pharmacist at Florida Hospital &ndash; East Orlando." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "clayville@cop.ufl.edu" ;
