    ns1:overview "Professor Nygren is Chair-Elect of the Faculty Senate, and is scheduled to become Chair in 2011-12. He is past Chair of the Senate Policy Council on Research and Scholarship and of the Senate Policy Council on Academic Infrastructure, and is also Chair of the CLAS International Committee. In recent years, he has taught in UF programs in Florence, Italy and at Aix-en-Provence and the Paris Research Center in France. He continues to research film in a comparative world context and the production of digital video in a networked environment." .

