    ns1:researchOverview "The goal of Dr. Altpeter's research program is the molecular improvement of environmental and biotic stress tolerance in cereals, turf and biomass grasses. Alternatively strategies for quality improvement in grasses and cereals that are well adapted to stress are also investigated. Risk assessment and development of risk management strategies are important components of Dr. Altpeter's molecular grass improvement program." .

