    ns1:overview "Professor Chini has 70 publications in the areas of Construction Quality Management, Residential Framing, Fiber Composites, and Recycling and Reuse of Construction Materials. He is a member of ASCE, ACI, CMAA, and SAVE. He has also taught Construction Estimating, Timber Formwork Design and Construction." ;
