    ns1:researchOverview "Conduct research and extension activities in the soil and nutrient management areas for economically and environmentally sustainable agricultural production in Florida. Being the economic driver, management of water resources both for quantity and quality is an integral part of nutrient management research being currently conducted in the program." .

