    ns1:researchOverview "My research interests include design and analysis of algorithms, computational geometry, mesh generation, bio-geometric modeling, computational biology, and scientific computing. For details please have a look at my research statement and my publications. My research is funded by two recent NSF grants, one of which is a CAREER award." .

