    ns1:overview "Ron Cave joined the IRREC Faculty in 2002. He teaches two classes: Principles of Entomology, and Fundamentals of Pest Management.&nbsp; Dr. Cave's international experience includes work in Honduras, Paraguay, and El Salvador." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "rdcave@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(772) 468-3922 ext. 145" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Cave's research focuses on the biological control of invasive arthropods, particularly the cycad aulacaspis scale and the Mexican bromeliad weevil." .

