    ns1:researchOverview """<ul>\r
<li>3-Dimensional Golf Biomechanics and Kinetics</li>\r
<li>3-Dimensional Scapular Kinematics in Healthy and Injured Populations</li>\r
<li>Clinical Assessment of Scapular Dyskinesis</li>\r
<li>Orthopedic and Biomechanical Evaluation and Rehabilitation of Overhead-Throwing Athletes</li>\r
<li>Effects of Fatigue on Sensorimotor System Function </li>\r
<li>Enhancing Neuromuscular Control in the Upper-Extremity</li>\r
</ul>""" .

