    ns1:researchOverview "My research  program has two main foci: 1) the effects of disease on the  ecology of marine  organisms and, 2) the resilience and restoration of  benthic marine communities  (e.g., coral reefs and tropical hard-bottom  areas) affected by human or natural  disturbances.&nbsp; The two are not  mutually  exclusive in that the effects of disease are altered or  exacerbated by impacts  to the habitat structure that sessile  communities provide." .

