    ns1:overview "To provide the highest level of care in the field of pediatric otolaryngology, with a subspecialty interest in pediatric rhinology.&nbsp; To advance the knowledge and education of medical students, otolaryngology residents,&nbsp; other otolaryngologists, and pediatricians in the discipline of pediatric otolaryngology, utilizing both clinical care and research.&nbsp; To provide leadership, vision, and administrative excellence in the field of academic medicine.<br />" ;
