    ns1:overview "<p>Professor Spiker&rsquo;s creative activities focus on mainstream magazine writing, with an emphasis on health, fitness, and nutrition. He researches, reports, and writes stories for various national magazines, and also has worked and am working as a co-author on several health-related books. He also has a strong interest in other forms of writing, including narrative, profiles, essays, humor, and many other genres, as well as research/teaching interests in magazine writing, magazine covers, the magazine industry, and magazine design.</p>" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "tspiker@jou.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-6990" .

