    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Graham's research includes increasing understanding of the microbiology of citrus and   citrus soils for control of <em>Phytophthora spp.</em> and their interactions   with soil pests to promote citrus root  health; and studying survival, spread and host   resistance&nbsp;to citrus&nbsp;canker&nbsp;<em>caused by Xanthomonas citri</em> subsp. <em>citri</em> to develop more effective control measures." .

