    ns1:overview "Professor Kelley teaches women&rsquo;s health courses to  undergraduate students. Her prior teaching experience includes positions  at Santa Fe Community College, Lake City Community College, and Florida  State University. She also serves on the College of Nursing Faculty Organization  Environment and Resources Committee. She is a member of the Florida  Nurses Association, Sigma Theta Tau International and Association of  Women&rsquo;s Health, Obstetric, &amp; Neonatal Nursing (AWHONN)." ;
