    ns1:overview "Joe Larkin works with nPOD on the TCR Utilization in Type 1 Diabetes  Insulitis project.  He is currently an assistant professor in the  department of Microbiology and Cell Science where he also teaches a  graduate course on Immunology.  Dr. Larkin was the recipient of The  Association of Medical Laboratory Immunologists Travel Award in 2006." ;
