    ns1:overview "Professor Boyles teaches federal income taxation in the undergraduate and graduate curriculum. His research focuses on jurisprudence and he has published numerous articles in various law reviews and tax specialty publications. Professor Boyles has co-authored two editions of an American Accounting Association monograph and is also heavily involved with student organizations." ;
