    ns1:overview "<strong></strong>Dr. Philip Harmon is a native Hoosier; he pursued a  turfgrass pathology   research project at Purdue University where he  earned a Ph.D. Dr. Harmon joined   the faculty of the University of  Florida, Department of Plant Pathology in 2003,   when he accepted an  extension and research appointment. Responsibilities of his    appointment include plant pathology of turfgrass, ornamental plants, and  small   fruits." ;
