    ns1:researchOverview "<strong>Anchorage to Concrete:</strong> Experimental and analytical research projects on cast-in-place and post-installed (mechanical and bonded) anchor systems with a special interest in adhesive and grouted bonded anchor systems     <br /> <strong>Structural Behavior and Design:</strong> Experimental and analytical research projects to evaluate structural behavior where the goal of the projects is to present results in a form that can be adopted into structural design standards    <br /> <strong>Wind Engineering:</strong> Field studies and experimental research projects on the effects of wind and missile blown debris on structures" .

