    ns1:researchOverview "My  research and writing interests include family resilience and strengths  in family therapy, multicultural issues in family therapy, relationship  violence, and qualitative research methodology, particularly grounded  theory and narrative analysis. I have recently begun researching the  clinical use of family narratives in therapy, and the impact of family  narratives on the identity development of internationally adopted  children.<br />" .

