    ns1:researchOverview "My current research interests include the intersection of multiculturalism and the teaching and learning of mathematics and teachers&rsquo; mathematics content knowledge and. I focus on these topics through a variety of scholarly activities (e.g., research grant, manuscripts, professional development)." .

