    ns1:overview "John R. Chambers, Ph.D.is a Assistant Professor in Psychology at the Univeristy of Florida in Gainesville. He is interested in \"social psychology.\"" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "I'm interested in the general question of how the self colors our thoughts about the social world. Decades of research suggest that people are \"egocentric.\" <br />" .

