    ns1:overview "My research includes long term field studies, field experiments, GIS-based modeling, and collaboration with molecular geneticists to address ecological questions. I am interested in temperate and tropical systems, and work in ecosystems ranging from wetlands to semi-arid scrub and forests in Florida and South America." ;
