    ns1:overview "Dr. Treavor Boyer is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Environmental Engineering Sciences at the University of Florida. The focus of Dr. Boyer’s research is aquatic chemistry and water treatment. <br />" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "thboyer@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 846-3351" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "The long-term goals of his research program are (i) to understand the effect of DOM on physical, chemical, and biological processes and (ii) to apply the principles of ion exchange to natural and engineered systems. Biogeochemical Systems; Stormwater, Water Supply and Wastewater<br />" .

