    ns1:overview "Michael E. Robinson, Ph.D. is a Professor in the Department of Clinical and Health Psychology. He also serves as the Director of Research of the University of Florida Spine Care Program and is the Director of the Center for Pain Research and Behavioral Health. Dr. Robinson also holds joint appointments in Physical Therapy and Anesthesiology." ;
