    ns1:researchOverview "My research incorporates studies of students' development  in and responses to literature, the incorporation of multicultural  literature in schools' curricula for children and adolescents, West  Indian immigrant populations and their adjustment in American schools,  and preparing preservice teachers to teach diverse student populations." .

