    ns1:researchOverview "<p>My research  focuses on the integration of technology for teaching and learning in  higher education.&nbsp; My interests include 1) the ways in which students&rsquo;  informal use of new technologies can be leveraged by faculty in higher  education coursework 2) faculty use of new technologies and their  transition to online teaching 3) the design and facilitation of online  and blended courses and 4) knowledge development in online learning  communities.&nbsp;</p>" .

