    ns1:overview "Co-director for the Center Food-Drug Interaction Research and Education.Hartmut Derendorf has been teaching Biopharmaceutics, Pharmacokinetics and Clinical Pharmacokinetics at UF since 1983. Derendorf has published over 340 scientific publications and given over 650 presentations at national or international meetings. He has published six textbooks in English and German.<br />" ;
