    ns1:overview "Dr. Burks specializes in robotics and machine systems development, he is engaged in many projects at any given time, some large and some small. Burks tackles this workload with the assistance of a half dozen graduate students and several technicians. He guides their efforts through the Agricultural Robotics and Mechatronics Group (ARMg), which also draws on the expertise of other ABE professors with related research activities." ;
