    ns1:researchOverview "We study the mechanisms by which bacteria sense changes in the environment and relay this information to coordinate complex processes such as stationary phase adaptation, central metabolism, and biofilm formation. Our findings are being investigated for the development of new approaches for metabolic engineering and new targets for antimicrobial therapy.<br /><br />" .

