    ns1:overview "Dr. Schaffer teaches Family Nurse Practitioner clinical and role  courses. She also is the chair of the Department of Women's, Children's  and Family Nursing. She currently serves as an alternate member of the Health Sciences Institutional Review Board (IRB01). She is a  member of Florida Nurses Association and Sigma Theta Tau as well as the Shands Credentialing Committee and the Shands Patient  Safety and Nursing Quality Council." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "sdschaf@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-6366" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "<strong></strong>Dr. Schaffer is interested in developing  strategies to improve adherence to chronic medication in adults and in  drug/herbal interactions." .

