    ns1:researchOverview "Two main research areas are explored. The synthesis of new polymers from biorenewable feedstocks with the specific intent of mimicking commodity thermoplastics. The development of organometallic, single-site catalysts for the polymerization of olefins to polyolefins having novel structure and properties." .

