    ns1:overview "Dr. Glenn D. Israel is Professor in the Department of Agricultural Education and Communication at University of Florida. His responsibilities include Extension (50%), Research (35%) and Teaching (15%) functions. Withing AEC, he works with other faculty and staff in the Program Development and Evaluation Center (PDEC) to support Extension state-wide program teams, provide in-service training in program development and evaluation, develop extension publications about program development and evaluation topics and to assist county faculty and/or provide direct service to extension clientele. Other responsibilities include conducting research in my areas of specialization, teaching in program evaluation and serving on graduate committees. He also provides service to UF/IFAS, the department and to professional organizations." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "gdisrael@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-2586" .

