    ns1:researchOverview "Recently, Dr. Hill has investigated the trophic ecology of morphologically similar, native and non-native predatory fishes; predation of non-native pest fish in aquaculture ponds; relative vulnerability of transgenic and wild-type ornamental fishes to predation; and predation by native fishes as a biological resistance to species invasions." .

