    ns1:researchOverview "My research interests are aimed at understanding the geomorphic evolution of landscapes that result from the interaction of coastal, fluvial, and tectonic processes.&nbsp; Primary methods include real-time instrumentation to examine physical processes, digital elevation analyses to examine landscape form, and numerical modeling to link process and form together. I&rsquo;m currently focusing on field sites along the Florida Atlantic coast, the Southern California bight, and the Kenai Peninsula in South Central Alaska." .

