    ns1:researchOverview "Characterization of bacterial alginate, pectate lyase, and endoxylanae activities; gene/enzyme and structure/function relationships, Development of bacterial glycohydrolases and lyases for the conversion of plant biomass to alternative fuels and biobased chemicals, Characterization of adhesins as virulence factors of bacteria of the genus Pasteuria for the biocontrol phytopathogenic nematodes, and Genetic and biochemical characterization of adhesins as virulence factors involved in the phytopathogenicity of Xanthomonas spp." .

