    ns1:overview "Mr. Sampson is the Director of the McTrans Center at the University of Florida, located in Gainesville, Florida. Mr. Sampson has more than 30 years of experience in transportation and traffic engineering and has worked on capacity analysis and signal timing from various perspectives for most of his career." ;
