    ns1:researchOverview "My area of research and creative work is in the symbiotic relationship between costume design and technology. This is a continuation of my professional career as both a costume designer and a costume technician. I firmly believe that design and the physical implementation of that design are inextricably entwined. Better knowledge, experience and aptitude for one area improve one&rsquo;s ability in the other area. I explore this concept through continued professional experience in the field and through research on pertinent topics for conference presentations.<br />" .

