    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Escobedo's research and extension work focuses on urban and community  forest  management and planning, the ecosystem services of urban and urbanizing   forests, and the effects of urbanization and other disturbances such as   hurricanes and invasive woody plants on forests and human settlements." .

