    ns1:overview "Professor George Christou's research group is part of the Department of Chemistry at the University of Florida, located in Gainesville, FL. This is a synthetic, bioinorganic and physical inorganic chemistry group.<br />" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "christou@chem.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-6737" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Our main research interests are focused on bioinorganic chemistry and magnetic applications of&nbsp; multinuclear metal complexes. This group has always been very international,with members from all over the world." .

