    ns1:outreachOverview """<p>Reviewer, Reducing Loss to Follow-up after Failure to Pass Newborn Screening grant program, Health Resources and Services Administration (2009).</p>\r
<p>Team Leader, Hurricane Katrina Rescue and Recovery Teams in Gulfport, MS (2004-05).</p>\r
<p>Leader, Projecto Yucatan. Medical mission trip for UF audiology, medicine, pharmacy and nursing students to Mayan villages (2004- ).</p>\r
<p>Site Visitor, State of Louisiana Board of Regents (for 3 state institutions, 2001-03) and Kuwait Center for the Amalgamaton of People with Special Needs (2006).</p>\r
<p>Expert witness regarding assistive technologies (2001-02), audibility of acoustic signaling devices (1992), hearing loss following motor vehicle accident (1991).</p>\r
<p>Faculty Advisor, University of Florida chapter, National Student Speech-Language-Hearing Association (1990-91).</p>""" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "sgriff@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-3725" .

