    ns1:researchOverview "I  am engaged in a program of research exploring the relationships between  reasoning and reading and the metacognitive behaviors associated with  science text reading. I have published research in logical reasoning,  reading comprehension, gender issues in development, educational needs  of children with HIV/AIDS, and gifted adolescents. My current research  program focuses on a cognitive-developmental approach to the study of  reasoning processes in the comprehension of narratives and science  texts." .

