    ns1:researchOverview "My current research seeks to  advance rigor and applicability of qualitative research methodology for  the broader purpose of improving the quality of educational research. I  am especially interested in facilitating epistemological and  methodological awareness among qualitative researchers and highlighting  the importance of rigorous research applications. Furthermore, as a part  of my research I develop systematic research approaches that could be  utilized by qualitative researchers and I use my own empirical research  to illustrate some possible ways in which systematic and theoretically  grounded qualitative research could be accomplished and implemented in  various research contexts. In particular, my research, scholarship, and  conceptual contributions bring together three aspects of qualitative  methodology: 1) the promotion of epistemology and the role of knowledge  production in qualitative research, 2) validity in qualitative research,  and 3) the development of participant-driven methodologies." .

