        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n961183380> ;
    ns1:overview "<p><strong></strong>Dr. Snider teaches undergraduate  students in psychiatric mental health nursing, law and ethics,  introduction to research, and the Honors Program. She teaches masters  students in ethics and group psychotherapy. She teaches the doctoral  course in ethics.&nbsp;<strong></strong>Dr. Snider presently serves as chairperson  of the College of Nursing Search Committee; she is a member at large on  the Academic Affairs Committee and is a member of the Progression  Examination Committee for the doctoral program. She co-chairs the Ethics  Committee at Shands at Vista.</p>" .

