    ns1:overview "Johanna Cleary worked for 25 years in journalism, including stints in public television, commercial and public radio, and newspapers. She was also a marketing and public relations practitioner for media and arts organizations. Cleary is one of three co-authors of the book The Best of Pulitzer Prize News Writing, published in 1986." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "jcleary@jou.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 846-0226" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Clearys work has been published in Journalism and Mass Communication Quarterly, Mass Communication and Society, Journalism and Mass Communication Educator, the Journal of Radio Studies, the Cardozo Arts &amp; Entertainment Law Journal, the International Journal on Media Management and Electronic News." .

