    ns1:researchOverview "Our laboratory performs research in three main areas: (1) host-pathogen interactions between <em>Beauveria bassiana</em>,  a fungal pathogen of arthropods, and their  insect hosts, (2) directed  evolution of fungi. Adaptation and  improvement of fungi for  biotechnological applications, and (3)  development of novel surface  active biopolymers." .

