    ns1:researchOverview """<p>My research revolves around  curriculum and instruction, classroom management, and teacher  leadership. Specifically, I have targeted much of my research in the  areas of how integrating culturally responsive pedagogy and classroom  management and technology into the curriculum to promote powerful  learning experiences for all learners.&nbsp; This is not just a curriculum  and instruction issue but also one of social justice. Although I work  with all grade levels, I target my efforts research efforts toward  middle and secondary learners and educators</p>\r
<p>&nbsp;</p>""" .

