    ns1:overview "Dr. Munoz-Carpena specializes in Surface, vadose zone and groundwater hydrology; Water quality modeling; Water conservation in irrigation system design and operation." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "carpena@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-1864 ext. 287" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Research emphasis is on hydrologic processes and includes water management and hydrologic field and modeling studies of contaminant transport, transformation and fate processes, and of water-related agricultural production practices, which will improve the compatibility of agriculture with the surrounding natural ecosystem and quickly expanding urban population in Florida and elsewhere.<br />" .

