    ns1:overview "My doctoral degree is in Clinical Psychology with a specialty in Clinical Neuropsychology. As an Assistant Professor in the Department of Clinical and Health Psychology, I am fortunate to work with and mentor talented graduate and undergraduate students at the University of Florida, Gainesville, Florida." ;
