    ns1:researchOverview "Microbial biochemistry and physiology; global regulatory mechanisms; regulatory proteolysis including proteasomes and other energy-dependent proteases;post-translational modification (acetylation, phosphorylation, small protein modifiers); molecular genetics, genomics, and proteomics; extremophiles (methogenic and halophilic archaea); enzyme structure and function; biotechnology; metabolic engineering; microbial conversion of biomass to renewable fuels and chemicals." .

