    ns1:overview "<p>Professor Hinze is the Director of Graduate Program and Director of the Fluor Program for Construction Safety at Riinker School of Building Construction. He is the author of three text books, published over 70 papers in refereed professional journals. He has also published extensively in trade journals and presented papers at conferences world wide.</p>" ;
