    ns1:overview "Professor Denslow teaches principles of macroeconomics to a class of 1,000 students via TV replay. He has been recognized numerous times by students and his peers for his outstanding teaching. His current research analyzes spatial price indexes, comparisons of the cost of living across geographic areas ranging from counties to nations. Professor Denslow also serves as Director of the Policy Studies Program for the Bureau of Economic and Business Research. <br />" .

