    ns1:researchOverview "Methodological aspects: Systems Engineering; Mathematical Modeling of Complex Networks; Op- erations Research/Optimization; Robustness/resiliency characteristics of networked systems in ad- verse/uncertain environments; Provably optimal low-cost attack-tolerant network design strategies; Robust optimization/risk management techniques; Large-scale random graph models and related asymp- totic phase transition problems; Data mining techniques.  Interdisciplinary applications: Sustainability/resiliency of critical network infrastructure (trans- portation, communication, supply networks, etc.); Military systems; Electricity networks (smart grid);Health care/biomedicine/biochemistry." .

