    ns1:overview "Dr. Molleda is an associate professor and graduate coordinator in the Department of Public Relations of the University of Florida (UF). He is also an affiliated faculty of the UF Center for Latin American Studies and UF Paris Research Center. Adding to Dr. Molleda&rsquo;s outreach to the professional community, he currently acts as a founding member of the Institute for Public Relations&rsquo; Commission on Global Public Relations Research." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "jmolleda@jou.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-1223" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Molleda&rsquo;s research interests are in global corporate public relations management, including coordination and control mechanisms and transnational crises; public relations practices, regulations, professionalism, and social roles in Latin America; multi-sector partnerships creation and maintenance; and the interplay between the construct of authenticity and strategic communication practices." .

