    ns1:overview "Dr. Alan R. Katritzky is the Kenan Professor at the University of Florida and is a world renowned expert in heterocyclic chemistry." ;
    ns1:researchOverview "A common theme of research in the group is Organic Synthesis, especially Heterocyclic Synthesis. We are engaged both in developing new synthetic methods and preparing specific compounds for investigation in a whole range of applications." .

