    ns1:overview "Barbara Mennel received her PhD in German Studies from Cornell University in 1998. She holds a joint appointment in English and in the German section of the Department of Languages, Literatures, and Cultures. She is the current Director of the Center for Film and Media Studies." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "mennel@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 294-2820" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Her research interests include transnational cinematic practices, feminist and queer theory, minority cultural production in Germany, European cinema, and the intersection of urban studies and cinema studies." .

