    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Comerford's research focuses include modeling soil nutrient bioavailability with a focus on forest  environments; soil/root interactions; inorganic and organic soil P  chemistry as related to bioavailability; soil management in a forestry  context; tropical soils; and forested wetlands." .

