    ns1:overview "Stephen D. Anton is an Assistant Professor with a joint appointment in the Department of Clinical and Health Psychology and the Department of Aging and Geriatric Research. He specializes in health promotion, preventive medicine, and healthy weight management. Dr. Anton currently supervises an advanced practicum rotation in rural primary care within the Dixie County public health department.<br />" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "santon@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-7514" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "His research focuses on developing and testing the efficacy of lifestyle based (e.g., caloric restriction and exercise) and alternative treatment modalities (e.g., nutraceuticals) for preventing and treating metabolic conditions associated with aging, such as obesity and type 2 diabetes." .

