    ns1:researchOverview "The interaction between working memory, executive function and language ability during language use. Language use in adults with and without brain pathology. Sentence production process. Semantic impairments. Cognitive-Motor interference—bidirectional effects of performing language and cognitive tasks while simultaneously performing motor tasks." .

