    ns1:overview "Brenda Wiens, Ph.D. is a Clinical Assistant Professor at the University of Florida in Gainsville. She is a member of the American Psychological Association, APA Division 53-Society of Clinical Child and Adolescent Psychology and the APA Division 54-Society of Pediatric Psychology. Her interests include: school-linked mental health services, clinical child and pediatric psychology, rural issues, training and education on the mental health effects of disasters and terrorism." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "wiens@phhp.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-5120" .

