    ns1:overview "Our laboratory has been studying the role of environmental agents that include pesticides, heavy metals and infectious agents in the development of neurological disorders including Parkinson&rsquo;s disease, a degenerative movement disorder resulted from a progressive destruction of the nigrostriatal dopamine-releasing neurons in the midbrain." ;
