    ns1:overview "Ian Flood is an Associate Professor at the Rinker School of Business Construction and Director of the \"Center for Advanced Construction Information Modeling\". The mission of the center is to educate and facilitate the adoption by members of the AECO industry of new and emerging technologies and to promote an improved information exchange process among its various sectors through the implementation of advanced construction information modeling (ACIM), Virtual Design and Construction (VDC), and Information Technology in the delivery of construction projects." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "flood@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 273-1159" .

