    ns1:overview "Morris (Marty) Hylton III research focuses on preserving post-World War II (1945-ca.1975) modern architecture and interiors, particularly learning environments. Currently, he is working on a project to document the innovative educational facilities of the Sarasota Public School Program (1953-1960)." ;
