    ns1:overview "Dr. Merlo is a licensed clinical psychologist and currently serves as Director of Psychotherapy Training for the residency program and Chief of the Division of Undergraduate Education. She directs the Addiction Medicine Public Health Research Group and remains active in research, teaching, clinical intervention, and service. Dr. Merlo collaborates with faculty from other colleges, as well as the Area Health Education Centers across Florida to provide training in motivational interviewing interventions for health professions students, smoking cessation counselors and other healthcare providers. She is a member of several scientific and professional societies, and serves as a reviewer for various academic journals in psychology and psychiatry." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "lmerlo@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 265-4357" .

