    ns1:researchOverview "A significant portion of my research has focused on instructional practices, although these studies have intersected with topics encompassing: critical thinking, curriculum development, faculty development, postsecondary education, professional education, qualitative research, and program evaluation. To a lesser degree, my lines of inquiry have incorporated learning styles, mentorship, science education, organizational change, and complementary therapies." .

