    ns1:researchOverview "Water and Solute transport in aggregated and non-aggregated soil materials. Characterization of spatial and temporal variability of soil properties that influence water and solute movement under different crop-management practices. Sorption of agrochemicals (ionogenic and neutral organics, and nutrients) on soils and organoclays in aqueous and mixed solvent systems. Transformation of agrochemicals (pesticides and nutrients) in soils. Modeling fate and transport of agrochemicals in the environment (under various cropping systems)." .

