    ns1:overview "The focus of Dr. Greg Kiker's career is the ecological modeling and management of natural systems. He specializes in the integration of ecological, hydrological and decision modeling; environmental risk, decision analysis and model linkage integration for decision support. <br />" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "gkiker@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-1864" .

