    ns1:researchOverview "In general, his research interests focus on Bayesian metholodogy.              He has done considerable work on the development of models for (incomplete)              longitudinal data, paying special attention to the dependence structure.              He has also worked on problems in environmental epidemiology (health              effects of air pollution) and modelling of a pollutant process over              space and time." .

