    ns1:researchOverview "Bacterial cell-to-cell communication and its role in structuring of  microbial communities and interactions with eukaryotic hosts. I also  focus on the biochemical strategies that eukaryotes use to disrupt gene  regulation in environmental and pathogenic bacteria." .

