    ns1:overview "Dr. Bowers is a world&rsquo;s expert in neuropsychology, memory disorders, and emotional processing in Parkinson&rsquo;s Disease. he studies the masked face, memory difficulties, cognitive processing, and is collaborating with other experts on better treatment approaches for Parkinson&rsquo;s disease." ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "dawnbowers@phhp.ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-3450" ;
    ns1:researchOverview "Dr. Bowers studies the masked face, memory difficulties, cognitive processing, and is collaborating with other experts on better treatment approaches for Parkinson&rsquo;s disease. She directs the Cognitive Neuroscience Lab which is one of the best in measuring cognitive problems in Parkinson&rsquo;s disease." .

