    ns1:overview "JOSEPH J. DELFINO is Professor in the Department of Environmental Engineering Sciences (EES), University of Florida, Gainesville, FL where he has received&nbsp;several \"Teacher of the Year\"&nbsp;awards and also a previous \"Top 100\" Researcher by the Office of Sponsored Research.&nbsp;He previously served on the City of Gainesville, FL Water Management Committee and the Alachua County (FL) Air Quality Commission. He&nbsp;was an Associate Editor for Water Quality Research for the Journal of the American Water Resources Association [2004-2012] and was a member of the Board of Directors [2009&ndash;2012] of the Universities Council on Water Resources [UCOWR]. He is currently on the Editorial Board of the Elsevier on-line journal Water Resources and Industry. He is a fellow of the AAAS and AWRA and is a 50 year member of the American Chemical Society.<br /><br />" ;
    ns1:primaryEmail "delfino@ufl.edu" ;
    ns1:primaryPhoneNumber "(352) 392-9377" .

