    ns1:researchOverview "Research duties include studies on sustainable greenhouse/nursery production practices based on<br />environmental conditions and minimizing environmental impact. Other projects investigate irrigation and fertilization requirements of ornamental shrubs during establishment in the landscape. Research is designed to provide basic and applied results that will add to the base of knowledge of information on production and use of ornamental plants." .

