    ns1:researchOverview "My research program addresses soil and water issues in the Everglades basin in south Florida.  I have focused on nutrient cycling in calcareous soils and the development of management practices to improve nutrient use efficiency, crop production, and water quality in agricultural and natural ecosystems." .

