    ns1:overview "Professor Martin s a Fellow of the Electrochemical Society, and served, or is serving, on the editorial advisory boards of Chemistry of Materials, Advanced Materials and Small.&nbsp; He is also the Senior Editor of the journal Nanomedicine.&nbsp; He is also an ISI highly cited author in materials science." ;
