    ns1:researchOverview "My primary  research interests include play therapy and expressive arts in  counseling, reputation enhancement, prevention of delinquency and  bullying (including relational aggression), interventions for  children/families in high poverty schools, school-family-community  collaboration, and mental health counseling in schools." .

