    ns1:researchOverview "Conduct weed management research in agronomic crops, with emphasis on physiological aspects of herbicides on weeds and crops including transgenic cropping technology. Also conduct studies in the area of weed biology and environmental and physiochemical factors influencing herbicidal activity and persistence." .

