    ns1:researchOverview """<ul>\r
<li>Physical activity effect on improving the quality of life for people of all ages with disabilities </li>\r
<li>Exercise therapy for people with peripheral arterial disease</li>\r
<li>Sports medical considerations for people with disabilities</li>\r
<li>Stretching techniques for improved function &amp; health</li>\r
<li>Fitness programs for people with intellectual disabilities</li>\r
<li>Inclusive teaching methods and equipment for people with disabilities</li>\r
</ul>""" .

