    ns1:researchOverview """<ul>\r
<li>Habitat associations and host plant relations of grasshoppers</li>\r
<li>Development of management practices for grasshoppers</li>\r
<li>Insect ecology, especially insect-plant relationships<br />Insect pest management, especially feeding deterrents, biological control, damage assessment, and economic thresholds</li>\r
<li>Current research projects: ecology of redbay ambrosia beetle, vector of laurel wilt; chemical management of grasshoppers; ecology of carrion-feeding flies; identification and ecology of agriculturally important terrestrial molluscs (slugs and snails); importance of insects in the ecology of vertebrate wildlife</li>\r
</ul>""" .

