    ns1:researchOverview """<p>My Research Interests are:</p>\r
<p>Novel approaches to education and training in forensic science.</p>\r
<p>The passage of drugs and metabolites across the blood/ brain barrier and the placental barrier, and the subsequent distribution, metabolism and elimination of these drugs.</p>\r
<p>Development of novel extraction and analytical techniques; FTIR, solid phase extraction, column switching techniques and supercritical fluid extraction and chromatography for the examination of drugs.</p>\r
<p>Investigation of the relationship between drug abuse and immune suppression</p>""" .

